        "description": "In the upcoming Upper Bracket Semifinal 1 match between FURIA Esports and MVK Esports in the Worlds Play-In, initially scheduled for October 15, 2026 at 2:00 PM ET:\n\nThis market is about the total kills in Game 1.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"Over\" if the total kills in Game 1 is 31 or more. Otherwise, it will resolve to \"Under\".\n\nIf the match is canceled (not played at all), this market will resolve to 50-50.\n\nIf the match is postponed, it must be rescheduled to a start time on or before October 29, 2026 at 11:59 PM ET (14 calendar days after the originally scheduled start of October 15, 2026 at 2:00 PM ET). If, by that deadline, the most recently announced rescheduled start time is on or before the deadline, this market resolves based on the result of the match as played. Otherwise, this market resolves 50-50, regardless of whether the match is subsequently played.\n\nIf Game 1 is never played due to forfeit, disqualification, or walkover, this market will resolve to 50-50.\n\nIf Game 1 begins but is not completed, this market will resolve to 50-50.\n\nIf Game 1 is remade, resolution will be based on the total kills in the remade game only.\n\nThe resolution source for this market will be official information from https://gol.gg/esports/home. However, if https://gol.gg/esports/home has not published final results within 2 hours after the event’s conclusion, a consensus of credible reporting may be used instead including video evidence.\n",
